"西樓公（杞君）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"西樓公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0004","c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0008"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p028","quote":"西樓公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p028","quote":"西樓公"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p028","quote":"東樓公生西樓公，西樓公生題公，題公生謀娶公。謀娶公當周厲王時。謀娶公生武公。武公立四十七年卒，子靖公立。靖公二十三年卒，子共公立。共公八年卒，子德公立。德公十八年卒，弟桓公姑容立。桓公十七年卒，子孝公丐立。孝公十七年卒，弟文公益姑立。文公十四年卒，弟平公郁立。平公十八年卒，子悼公成立。悼公十二年卒，子隱公乞立。七月，隱公弟遂弒隱公自立，是為釐公。釐公十九年卒，子湣公維立。湣公十五年，楚惠王滅陳。十六年，湣公弟閼路弒湣公代立，是為哀公。哀公立十年卒，湣公子敕立，是為出公。出公十二年卒，子簡公春立。立一年，楚惠王之四十四年，滅杞。杞後陳亡三十四年。","source_term":"生"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji036-046","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"rdo_wsn_30x"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p001510"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","mention_count":4,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi:m027-0000","c-shiji-036-chenqi:m027-0035","c-shiji-036-chenqi:m028-0000","c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0033"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-036-chenqi:p027","c-shiji-036-chenqi:p028","c-shiji-036-chenqi:p033"],"passage_count":3}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-036-chenqi"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji036-045","subject_person_id":"rdo_wsn_30